  "notes": "Kitchen sink for the LuatOS ESP32C3-CORE. Blink: timer -> LED D5 (GPIO 13). Button on GPIO 3 lights LED D4 (GPIO 12) while held. adc on GPIO 0 sends readings to debug. Single NeoPixel on GPIO 6 (header pin 22): colour cycle, breathe or police flash; press BOOT (GPIO 9) for the next effect."
